OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 25 MAY
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GBritish trumpeter Byron Wallen
OL,6,     Gselects three of his best-loved
OL,7,     Grecords by Miles Davis to
OL,8,     Gcelebrate the centenary of one of
OL,9,     Gthe most influential figures in
OL,10,     G20th-century music.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GEva Ollikainen conducts the WDR
OL,13,     GSymphony Orchestra, Cologne in
OL,14,     GStrauss' tone poem 'A Hero's
OL,15,     GLife'. Penny Gore presents.
